Text=Yet though she can be fickle, my art demands unflinching devotion. When she will not support me, I must support her and so I was forced to take a loan from Shylocke. As gold is precious to him, he demanded collateral that is precious to me. And now Sytheria languishes in the maw of that serpent. What fools we mortals be!
